          "id": "step-1-1",
          "step": "1.1",
          "claim": "Componentwise conjugation of $[\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2]+PQ=0$ gives $[\\overline{\\alpha_1},\\overline{\\alpha_2}]+\\overline P\\,\\overline Q=0$. By [F2], this is exactly $\\mu_{\\mathbb C}(B,I,J)=0$.",
