          "source": "thm-a-flat-connection-admits-local-parallel-frames",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "A connection on a finite-rank smooth vector bundle $E\\to M$ is flat if and\nonly if every point of $M$ has a neighborhood carrying a local frame\n$(e_1,\\ldots,e_r)$ of parallel sections, meaning $\\nabla_Xe_a=0$ for every\nlocal vector field $X$ and every $a$.",
