      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "step": "1.1",
          "claim": "In a local unitary frame let $F_{\\det A}$ be the curvature of the induced connection on $\\det E$. The induced connection on the top exterior power has local connection matrix $\\operatorname{tr}A$, hence $F_{\\det A}=\\operatorname{tr}F_A$. Put $\\eta=-i\\operatorname{tr}F_A$, a real two-form because $F_A$ is anti-Hermitian. By [F2], $d\\eta=0$, and the linearity of trace in $F_A^+=0$ gives $*_g\\eta=-\\eta$.",
