          "id": "step-2-1",
          "claim": "Apply the same argument to $\\xi^\\vee\\in H^1(Z,\\mathcal E^\\vee(-2))$ and the assumed injective map $\\mathcal P_{\\mathcal E^\\vee}$; [F2] gives a zero image and injectivity gives $\\xi^\\vee=0$. Hence $H^1(Z,\\mathcal E^\\vee(-2))=0$, proving both asserted vanishings conditional on the specified transforms.",
          "step": "2.1",
