          "claim": "From [A3], $\\operatorname{ch}(\\mathcal E(t))=Ne^{tH}-kH^2e^{tH}$ and $\\operatorname{td}(T_Z)=1+2H+\\tfrac{11}{6}H^2+H^3$. Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch [F7] gives $\\chi(\\mathcal E(t))=N\\binom{t+3}{3}-k(t+2)$, with values $k,-N+2k,0,-k$ for $t=-3,-4,-2,-1$. The Euler sequences $0\\to\\mathcal O(-4)\\to\\mathcal O(-3)^{\\oplus4}\\to\\Omega_Z^2\\to0$ and $0\\to\\Omega_Z^1(-1)\\to\\mathcal O(-2)^{\\oplus4}\\to\\mathcal O(-1)\\to0$ give Euler characteristics $k,2k+N,k$ for the three monad coefficient bundles. Steps 1.2, 2.1, 2.2 and 3.1 leave only $H^2$ in each, so these values are the dimensions.",
