        {
          "id": "step-3-1",
          "step": "3.1",
          "claim": "At zero real moment, step 1.1 gives $DD^\\dagger=\\operatorname{diag}(f,f)$ with $f=a^\\dagger a=b^\\dagger b$. Regularity makes $f$ positive definite by injectivity of $a$, and hence makes $D$ onto. Conversely, surjectivity of $D$ makes both diagonal blocks positive definite; $a$ is injective and $b^\\dagger$ onto, so step 2.1 gives regularity. Direct multiplication shows $P^\\dagger=P$, $P^2=P$, $DP=0$, and $P$ is the identity on $\\ker D$. Inversion of positive matrices is smooth, so [F2] gives the rank-$N$ smooth kernel bundle. Projection of the trivial Hermitian connection is a metric connection because for kernel sections $s,t$, $d\\langle s,t\\rangle=\\langle Pds,t\\rangle+\\langle s,Pdt\\rangle$.",
